[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0224","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0224.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-9995","title":"TBK DVR4104/DVR4216 登录绕过漏洞","description":"TBK DVR4104、DVR4216 系列网络硬盘录像机（DVR）及其贴牌设备（包括 Novo、CeNova、QSee、Pulnix、XVR 5 in 1、Securus、Night OWL、DVR Login、HVR Login、MDVR Login 等品牌）存在身份认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何凭证，只需在 HTTP 请求中添加 `Cookie: uid=admin` 头部即可绕过登录认证，进而通过向 `device.rsp?opt=user&cmd=list` 接口发送请求，获取设备中所有用户的明文密码等敏感凭据信息。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度低，影响范围广泛，大量贴牌 DVR 设备均受影响。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-9995"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-10T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:07:27Z","remediation":"建议立即联系设备厂商确认是否有固件更新，如无官方补丁，应在防火墙层面限制仅内网 IP 访问 DVR 的 Web 管理端口（默认 80/443），切勿将设备直接暴露在公网。同时禁用不必要的远程 Web 管理功能，或通过 VPN 访问设备管理界面。对于已受影响的设备，修改默认管理员口令并限制 Cookie 认证来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://misteralfa-hack.blogspot.cl/2018/04/tbk-vision-dvr-login-bypass.html","http://misteralfa-hack.blogspot.cl/2018/04/update-dvr-login-bypass-cve-2018-9995.html","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/new-hacking-tool-lets-users-access-a-bunch-of-dvrs-and-their-video-feeds/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44577/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44577","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9995.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2018/CVE-2018-9995.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2018/CVE-2018-9995.md","https://github.com/jorhelp/Ingram/blob/166cd29f3252599417db8f657f25c2edcf55d853/Ingram/pocs/cve-2018-9995.py","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/网络设备漏洞/DVR 登录绕过漏洞 CVE-2018-9995.md","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/f4596359a8b7b31ae4d231eeaec711706b892ed2/docs/wiki/iot/DVR/DVR 登录绕过漏洞 CVE-2018-9995.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-9995-3669.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/iot/DVR-登录绕过漏洞-CVE-2018-9995.md","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/TBK DVR Login Bypass（CVE-2018-9995）.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/42afd254d53725a0da501aa4583bda786dddcd0d/data/by-cve/CVE-2018-9995.md","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-9995.js","https://github.com/ezelf/CVE-2018-9995_dvr_credentials","https://github.com/Cyb0r9/DVR-Exploiter","https://github.com/0xDamian/CVE-2018-9995-rs","https://github.com/wr0x00/Lizard","https://github.com/X3RX3SSec/DVR_Sploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0224.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0067","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1217","title":"Dell EMC Avamar Installation Manager 访问控制缺失漏洞","description":"这是一个影响Dell EMC Avamar和Integrated Data Protection Appliance安装管理器的访问控制漏洞。受影响的设备版本包括Avamar Server 7.3.1、7.4.1和7.5.0，以及Integrated Data Protection Appliance 2.0和2.1。攻击者无需任何身份验证即可利用该漏洞，访问或修改Local Download Service (LDLS)凭据。这些凭据用于连接Dell EMC在线支持平台。如果攻击者将LDLS配置更改为无效配置，则Avamar Installation Manager可能无法成功连接到Dell EMC在线支持网站。此外，攻击者可以利用窃取的凭据登录到Dell EMC在线支持，冒充AVI服务执行操作。该漏洞通过缺失访问控制检查机制实现，攻击者仅需向目标发送特制的网络请求即可触发，导致credentials泄露和非法使用，CVSS评分9.8，威胁等级严重，由Microsoft在2024年8月安全更新中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1217"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-09T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:44Z","remediation":"建议立即应用 Dell EMC 官方发布的热修复补丁：Avamar 7.3.1 用户安装 HOTFIX 290316，Avamar 7.4.1 和 IDPA 2.0 用户安装 HOTFIX 291882，Avamar 7.5.0 和 IDPA 2.1 用户安装 HOTFIX 291881。补丁可从 Dell EMC 下载中心获取，安装无需重启。若暂时无法打补丁，可在防火墙层面限制对 Avamar Installation Manager 管理端口（默认 HTTPS 443）的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问，并禁用 LDLS（本地下载服务）功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Apr/14","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040641","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44441/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44441","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1217.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2018/CVE-2018-1217.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1217.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2018/1xxx/CVE-2018-1217.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-1217.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2018/CVE-2018-12177.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/d8cd4a1ae21f91a5e3337a6b189b078a1a73a4aa/plugins/dell/emc_avamar,emc_integrated_data_protection_appliance/CVE-2018-1217.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-1217","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1217.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-1217.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-1217_9.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0074","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1271","title":"Spring Framework Spring MVC 目录穿越漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Spring Framework 5.0 prior to 5.0.5 and 4.3 prior to 4.3.15版本中，应用程序可配置Spring MVC从文件系统提供静态资源（如CSS、JS、图片）。在Windows环境下，当静态资源从文件系统而非类路径或ServletContext提供时，攻击者可通过发送构造特殊的URL触发目录穿越漏洞，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证，网络可达，影响使用受影响版本的Spring MVC应用。修复方案为升级至Spring Framework 5.0.5或4.3.15及以上版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1271"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-06T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:53Z","remediation":"升级 Spring Framework 至 5.0.5 或 4.3.15 及以上版本以彻底修复该漏洞。若暂时无法升级，应将静态资源配置在 classpath 下而非 Windows 文件系统路径，或通过修改 WebMvcConfigurer 配置禁止外部访问静态资源目录，并在防火墙层面限制对敏感路径的直接访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujul2018-4258247.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuoct2018-4428296.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103699","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:1320","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:2669","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:2939","https://pivotal.io/security/cve-2018-1271","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujul2020.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2021.html","https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujan2019-5072801.html","https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujul2019-5072835.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45306","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1271.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-1271.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-1271.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-1271.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-1271/poc/pocsuite3/SpringMVC_CVE-2018-1271.py","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-1271.yaml","https://github.com/swisskyrepo/PayloadsAllTheThings/blob/83630e74eb354db306bddd4e665f00e662c18f97/Directory Traversal/README.md","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-1271.js","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-1271/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-1271.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-1271.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-1271.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0214","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0214.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8719","title":"WordPress WP Security Audit Log 插件敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 WP Security Audit Log 插件 3.1.1 版本存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该插件将安全审计日志文件存储在 `wp-content/uploads/wp-security-audit-log/` 目录下，但未对目录访问权限进行限制，导致任何未经身份认证的远程攻击者均可直接通过浏览器访问该目录下的日志文件。此外，这些日志文件会被 Google 等搜索引擎收录索引，进一步扩大了信息暴露面。攻击者可通过访问日志文件获取网站敏感操作记录、IP 地址等，为后续攻击提供情报支撑。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8719"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-04T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:05:17Z","remediation":"升级 WP Security Audit Log 插件到最新版本（建议 ≥4.0），并确保将其配置为不记录或隐藏敏感文件路径。立即更新 `wp-content/plugins/wp-security-audit-log/` 文件夹的权限，禁止目录列出。使用 `.htaccess` 或 Web 服务器配置禁止对 `/wp-content/uploads/wp-security-audit-log/*` 文件的直接访问。必要时可采取 WAF 规则阻止对这些目录的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44371/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44371","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8719.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-8719.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8719.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-8719.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-8719-3642.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-8719-3640.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-8719.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8719.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-8719.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8719.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-8719/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-8719.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0214.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0214.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0220","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0220.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-9205","title":"Drupal avatar_uploader 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Drupal avatar_uploader 模块 v7.x-1.0-beta8 版本中存在路径遍历漏洞。该模块的 view.php 文件未对用户身份进行有效验证，也未对文件路径参数进行充分的过滤与清理，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含 ../ 等目录跳转序列的恶意请求，读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、敏感数据等）。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，仅需网络访问即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Exploit-DB 已公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-9205"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-04T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:06:13Z","remediation":"立即卸载或禁用 Drupal avatar_uploader 模块（路径：管理→扩展），该模块已停止维护且无安全更新。如必须使用，在 view.php 中对 `$_GET['file']` 参数添加 `basename()` 过滤和 `preg_replace('/\\.\\./', '', $path)` 路径遍历防护，并限制文件读取目录为 `./uploads/`。建议迁移至 Drupal 官方 File 模块或 Image 模块替代头像上传功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.vapidlabs.com/advisory.php?v=202","https://www.drupal.org/project/avatar_uploader","https://www.drupal.org/project/avatar_uploader/issues/2957966","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44501/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44501","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9205.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2018/CVE-2018-9205.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2018/CVE-2018-9205.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e80f5d408ffad16b39381a0b04b1a01a2a54c308/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9205.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-9205.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-9205-3660.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-9205-3661.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-9205-3663.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-9205.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Drupai CMS/CVE-2018-9205.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-9205.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0220.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0219","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0219.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-9161","title":"Prisma Industriale Checkweigher PrismaWEB 硬编码凭证漏洞","description":"Prisma Industriale Checkweigher PrismaWEB 存在硬编码凭证漏洞，设备 Web 管理界面使用固定的管理员账号密码，远程攻击者可通过默认凭据直接登录后台获取系统控制权。该漏洞影响 PrismaWEB 系列工业称重设备，攻击者无需身份认证即可访问敏感配置信息并修改设备参数，对工业生产线安全构成严重威胁。厂商已发布安全更新，建议用户立即修改默认凭据并限制管理接口的网络访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2018-9161"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-04-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2018-04-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即联系 Prisma Industriale 获取修复版本或替代固件；如厂商已停止支持，须将 PrismaWEB 管理界面从公网断开，仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问（在防火墙或 HMS AnyBus-S WebServer 层面配置访问控制列表）。同时修改 `/user/scripts/login_par.js` 中的密码为强密码（至少 12 位含特殊字符），并重启 Web 服务使更改生效。作为临时缓解措施，部署 WAF 规则阻止对 `/user/scripts/login_par.js` 路径的外部访问，并监控对该路径的异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9161.yaml","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44276/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2018/CVE-2018-9161.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e80f5d408ffad16b39381a0b04b1a01a2a54c308/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9161.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-9161.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-9161-3659.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-9161-3658.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2018/9xxx/CVE-2018-9161.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Prisma Industriale Checkweigher PrismaWEB/CVE-2018-9161.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-9161.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9161.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-9161/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-9161.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0219.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0219.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0999","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0999.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7600","title":"Drupal Drupalgeddon2 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Drupal 核心存在远程代码执行漏洞（Drupalgeddon2），由于多个子系统对用户输入验证不充分，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP POST 请求，在默认或常见模块配置下触发该漏洞，实现任意 PHP 代码执行。该漏洞影响 Drupal 7.58 之前版本、8.3.9 之前的 8.x 版本、8.4.6 之前的 8.4.x 版本及 8.5.1 之前的 8.5.x 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需认证，利用复杂度低，已出现大量公开 PoC 和自动化利用工具，曾被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录。官方已在 2018 年 3 月发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议立即升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7600"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-29T07:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 Drupal 至 7.58、8.3.9、8.4.6 或 8.5.1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 PHP 的 `drupal_render` 相关表单处理功能，或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则拦截包含 `q=user/password&name[#post_render][]=printf&name[#type]=markup` 等特征的恶意请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103534","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040598","https://badpackets.net/over-100000-drupal-websites-vulnerable-to-drupalgeddon-2-cve-2018-7600/","https://blog.appsecco.com/remote-code-execution-with-drupal-core-sa-core-2018-002-95e6ecc0c714","https://github.com/a2u/CVE-2018-7600","https://github.com/g0rx/CVE-2018-7600-Drupal-RCE","https://greysec.net/showthread.php?tid=2912&pid=10561","https://groups.drupal.org/security/faq-2018-002","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/03/msg00028.html","https://research.checkpoint.com/uncovering-drupalgeddon-2/","https://twitter.com/RicterZ/status/979567469726613504","https://twitter.com/RicterZ/status/984495201354854401","https://twitter.com/arancaytar/status/979090719003627521","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4156","https://www.drupal.org/sa-core-2018-002","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44448/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44449/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44482/","https://www.synology.com/support/security/Synology_SA_18_17","https://www.tenable.com/blog/critical-drupal-core-vulnerability-what-you-need-to-know","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-7600","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44448","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7600.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7600.md","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2018-7600.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/drupal/cve-2018-7600_poc.py","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2018/CVE-2018-7600.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/web/drupal/CVE-2018-7600.md","https://github.com/r1cksec/cheatsheets/blob/d5cc6d24474592639d45560098a2ad4d1aacf089/exploit/CVE-2018-7600.md","https://github.com/baidu-security/app-env-docker/blob/33854e17cc9bba2d006234353394499ab91ceea8/src/drupal/8.3.3/CVE-2018-7600.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7600.py","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Drupal/CVE-2018-7600/README.md","https://github.com/SkewwG/VulScan/blob/fc092dfe3b95299307404258c7d5a51d501bd5e2/Drupal/CVE-2018-7600.py","https://github.com/dreadlocked/Drupalgeddon2","https://github.com/pimps/CVE-2018-7600","https://github.com/firefart/CVE-2018-7600"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0999.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0066","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0180","title":"Cisco IOS 登录增强功能拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 软件登录增强（Login Block）功能存在资源管理错误漏洞（CWE-399）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的登录请求，触发系统重载，导致拒绝服务（DoS）条件。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS 软件版本 15.4(2)T、15.4(3)M 及 15.4(2)CG 及更高版本的设备。攻击复杂度较高（AC:H），无需用户交互，无需特权，成功利用可造成目标设备完全不可用。Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0180"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:30:01Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至修复版本。受影响的版本包括 15.4(2)T、15.4(3)M、15.4(2)CG 及后续版本。请登录 Cisco Bug Search Tool 查询 CSCuz60599 获取对应平台的具体修复版本号，或通过 Cisco Software Checker 确认当前版本是否已修复。如无法立即升级，可考虑禁用 Login Block 功能（login block-for 配置）作为临时缓解，但该措施无法完全消除风险。CISA 已将该漏洞列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），强烈建议在 2022 年 3 月 17 日前完成升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103556","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-slogin","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0180","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0180.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0180.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0180.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0180.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0180","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0180.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0180.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-0180.md","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2018-0180.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0180.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0055","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0179","title":"Cisco IOS 登录增强功能资源管理错误拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 软件 Login Enhancements（登录增强）功能存在资源管理漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的登录请求，触发系统资源耗尽，导致设备重载（reload），造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS 软件版本 15.4(2)T、15.4(3)M、15.4(2)CG 及后续版本的设备。攻击复杂度较高，无需用户交互即可远程触发。Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0179"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:30:01Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至包含修复的 Cisco IOS 版本，具体修复版本请参考 Cisco Bug ID CSCuy32360 对应的软件版本，通过 Cisco 软件中心（software.cisco.com）获取。该漏洞无完整变通方案，对于 CSCuy32360 可采取临时缓解措施：先配置 login block-for 再配置 login quiet-mode access-class，或在配置两者后重新加载设备。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），存在在野利用，应优先处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103556","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-slogin","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0179","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0179.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0179.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0179.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0179.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0179","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0179.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0179.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-0179.md","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2018-0179.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0179.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0044","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0174","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE DHCP Option 82 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 及 IOS XE 软件的 DHCP Option 82 封装功能存在输入验证不完善漏洞。该漏洞源于受影响软件在处理 DHCP 中继代理发送的 DHCPv4 报文中的 Option 82 信息时，未能进行充分的输入验证。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 DHCPv4 数据包触发此漏洞，导致设备重载，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响大量 Cisco 交换机及路由器产品，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0174"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:30:00Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Cisco IOS/IOS XE 的修复版本。使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker（https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/selectIOSVersion.x）查询当前版本对应的修复版本号。对于 Cisco IOS 15.x 系列，升级至 15.2(4a)EA5 或 15.2(6)E0a 及更高版本；对于 Cisco IOS XE 系列，升级至对应修复版本。如无法立即升级，建议在受影响的 DHCP relay 接口上禁用 option 82 封装功能（no ip dhcp relay information policy encapsulate）作为临时缓解措施，但思科官方声明无有效变通方案，最终仍需升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103554","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040591","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-04","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-05","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-dhcpr3","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2018-06","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0174","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0174.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0174.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0174","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0174.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0174.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-0174.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2018/CVE-2018-0174/README.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-0174.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-0174.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0033","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0173","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE DHCPv4 Relay Reply 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 软件在处理 DHCPv4 数据包中封装的 Option 82 信息时存在输入验证不完整漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 DHCPv4 数据包，设备将其转发至 DHCPv4 服务器后，在处理服务器响应中封装的 Option 82 信息时触发错误，导致设备重新加载，造成拒绝服务（DoS）条件。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 软件的交换机设备，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0173"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:30:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 15.2(6)E0a 及以上版本，或 Cisco IOS XE 至 15.2(4a)EA5 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界部署 ACL 过滤非信任 DHCP 报文，并禁用 DHCP 中继 option 82 封装功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103545","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040591","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-04","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-05","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-dhcpr2","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2018-06","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0173","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0173.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0173.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0173.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0173","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0173.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-0173.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0173.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2018/CVE-2018-0173/README.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-0173.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2018/CVE-2018-0173/README_KO.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0022","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0172","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE DHCP Option 82 输入验证漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 及 IOS XE 软件的 DHCP Option 82 封装功能存在输入验证漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 DHCPv4 数据包，触发堆溢出条件，导致设备重载，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞源于软件在处理 DHCP 中继代理发来的 Option 82 信息时未进行充分的输入验证，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程利用。Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0172"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cisco IOS/IOS XE 至 Cisco 安全公告 cisco-sa-20180328-dhcpr1 中指定的修复版本。对于无法立即升级的设备，可在受影响的交换机上配置 DHCP snooping 并限制 DHCP relay agent 的信任端口，仅允许来自可信 relay agent 的 DHCP option 82 信息。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），需在 2022 年 3 月 17 日前完成修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103552","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040591","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-04","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-05","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-dhcpr1","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2018-06","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0172","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0172.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0172.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0172.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0172.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0172","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0172.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0172.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0172.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-0172.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-0172.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0012","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0175","title":"Cisco IOS Software、IOS XE Software和IOS XR Software LLDP子系统格式化字符串漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS、IOS XE 和 IOS XR 软件的链路层发现协议（LLDP）子系统中存在格式化字符串漏洞。该漏洞源于 LLDP 报文处理过程中对用户输入格式化字符串过滤不严，未经身份认证的相邻攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 LLDP 数据包触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致设备拒绝服务（DoS）或实现任意代码执行，获取设备高权限控制。CVSS 评分 8.0，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.0,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0175"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:30:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS/IOS XE 至 Cisco 于 2018 年 3 月 28 日发布的修复版本（如 15.6(3)M 及后续维护版），或升级 Cisco IOS XR 至 5.1.3 及以上版本（4.x/5.0 系列建议迁移至 5.3.4）。该漏洞无变通缓解措施，必须通过软件升级修复。在无法立即升级时，可在受影响的接口上执行 `no lldp enable` 全局关闭 LLDP 功能以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103564","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040586","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-03","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-04","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-05","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-lldp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0175","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0175.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0175.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0175.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0175","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0175.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0175.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-0175.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-0175.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-0175.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0011","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0171","title":"Cisco IOS软件远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 及 IOS XE 软件的 Smart Install 功能存在输入验证不当漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标设备 TCP 4786 端口发送精心构造的 Smart Install 消息，触发缓冲区溢出，导致设备重启造成拒绝服务、执行任意代码或触发看门狗崩溃。该漏洞影响开启 Smart Install 功能的 Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 设备，CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8（严重），攻击向量为网络、无需认证、无需用户交互，Cisco 已发布安全公告并发布修复版本修复该漏洞（CSCvg76186）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0171"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:59Z","remediation":"立即升级到受支持版本的Cisco IOS 15.4（最低15.4（17）版本）或Cisco IOS XE 3.18SP或更高版本；关闭设备上的Smart Install功能（命令：no smart-install）；在TCP端口4786上应用ACL限制访问；部署下一代防火墙执行 Deep Packet Inspection以阻止恶意Smart Install消息。若无法立即升级，可临时通过在设备配置文件中添加“no ip http access-class”命令来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103538","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040580","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-04","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-05","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-smi2","https://www.darkreading.com/perimeter/attackers-exploit-cisco-switch-issue-as-vendor-warns-of-yet-another-critical-flaw/d/d-id/1331490","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0171","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44451","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2018/CVE-2018-0171.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-0171.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/2911be3264007af9623a080cb675cf4852c504f7/2018/CVE-2018-0171.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ae7cbf60471587bdea4445c1578df6c016019acf/2018/CVE-2018-0171.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-0171.md","https://github.com/vuldb/cyber_threat_intelligence/blob/6a5017307e035c2b54c7afbe3bd8582497eafa96/campaigns/c/CVE-2018-0171/README.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-0171.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/4d788f269ad44a501a2252f60eed87a3837ec472/2018/CVE-2018-0171/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2018/CVE-2018-0171.md","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/securityaffairs_cve-2018-0171-russia-iran-attacks.html.txt","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0171","https://github.com/AlrikRr/Cisco-Smart-Exploit","https://github.com/hellowenying/CVE2018-0171"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0010","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0167","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE/IOS XR LLDP子系统缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS、IOS XE 和 IOS XR 软件的链路层发现协议（LLDP）子系统存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于 LLDP 协议处理过程中对数据包长度校验不充分，导致未经身份认证的相邻攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 LLDP 数据包触发缓冲区溢出，造成设备拒绝服务（DoS）或利用提升的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS、IOS XE 及 IOS XR 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Cisco 已在 2018 年 3 月 28 日发布安全公告修复此漏洞，该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV）。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0167"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:59Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Cisco 官方修复版本：Cisco IOS XR 用户升级至 5.3.4 或 5.1.3 及以上版本；Cisco IOS/IOS XE 用户升级至对应修复版本（参考 cisco-sa-20180328-lldp 公告）。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），且 Cisco PSIRT 确认存在野外利用，无变通缓解措施，必须通过升级修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103564","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040586","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-03","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-04","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-05","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-lldp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve